**Not claimed:** O(n) time. `char_at` / `utf8_byte_index` is still a Θ(n²) **time** tax (compiler-wide). SPRINT wording “stack buffer” is **stale** — path-A mechanism is slice, as `t1_memory.oot` already recorded.

